### Test Model List (should show all supported OpenAI model names)
GET http://localhost:5164/v1/models

### Test Function Calling with Model Mapping
POST http://localhost:5164/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt-4",
  "messages": [
    {"role": "user", "content": "What's the weather like in San Francisco?"}
  ],
  "tools": [
    {
      "type": "function",
      "function": {
        "name": "get_current_weather",
        "description": "Get the current weather in a given location",
        "parameters": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "location": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "The city and state, e.g. San Francisco, CA"
            },
            "unit": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": ["celsius", "fahrenheit"]
            }
          },
          "required": ["location"]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "tool_choice": "auto",
  "reasoning_effort": "medium",
  "max_tokens": 200
}

### Test Streaming with Model Mapping
POST http://localhost:5164/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt-4o",
  "messages": [
    {"role": "user", "content": "Write a short poem about artificial intelligence"}
  ],
  "stream": true,
  "reasoning_effort": "high",
  "max_tokens": 200
}